Lines returns bufio.Scanner.Err(), which loads the scanner's err field (and hides
io.EOF). The errors a Scanner records (bufio.ErrTooLong, ErrNegativeAdvance, ...,
reader errors) are stored in that field, which is out of scope: expected is an
explicit Unresolved(memory) "load of field err of *bufio.Scanner", not 0 entries.
